          <li><a href="#jwt-history">The Evolution of Tokens (Opaque to JWE)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#bearer-risk">Bearer Token Masquerade Risk</a></li>
          <li><a href="#scopes-vs-claims">Scope vs Claim vs Response Type</a></li>
